WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.830
Here is Petalesharro, Generous Chief,

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.950
a young Pawnee leader who traveled
with the same delegation.

3
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:10.860
Eastern newspapers had already made him famous
for rescuing a captive Comanche girl

4
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.190
who was about to be sacrificed
in a Pawnee ceremony.

5
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:19.650
King gives him real dignity:
the huge feathered headdress, the robe.

6
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.030
But the reason he came
to Washington has been painted out.

7
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.560
Only the peace medal
on its red ribbon hints

8
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.850
at why he was standing
in front of the painter.
